#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/instrumentation/events/index.rst:10
msgid ""
"This module pairs nested ``run_before_pass``/``run_after_pass`` callbacks, "
"assigns stable execution order and parent/depth metadata, and drains "
"incomplete frames when a pass fails. Consumers remain responsible for "
"choosing what to snapshot and how to render or persist the resulting data."
msgstr ""

